        "original_id": "48591343-4ca1-5899-8e7c-0484f3c8ea80",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Skittles\n- Companies: Wrigley Company, Mars, Inc.\n- People: Mars family\n- Places: McLean, unincorporated Fairfax County, Virginia, United States\n- Entertainment Works: Darkened Skye\n- Characters/Roles: She\n- Concepts: magic, firearms, melee weapons, energy weapons\n\nFacts:\n- Skittles is a brand of fruit-flavoured sweets that is currently produced and marketed by the Wrigley Company.\n- The Wrigley Company is a division of Mars, Inc.\n- Mars, Inc. is headquartered in McLean, in unincorporated Fairfax County, Virginia, United States.\n- Mars, Inc. is entirely owned by the Mars family.\n- In Darkened Skye, she does not use firearms.\n- In Darkened Skye, she can perform magic using Skittles candies.\n- In Darkened Skye, she can use her staff as a melee weapon.\n- In Darkened Skye, her staff also becomes an energy weapon when used in conjunction with Skittles.",
